WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.419
[Megatron] Decepticons,

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:05.588
finish this war!

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.840
[Decepticons grunt]

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:11.344
-Optimus, go!
-[growls] For Cybertron!

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.682
[Prime grunting]

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.684
-[loud clank]
-[Prime groans]

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:23.356
[growling]
I won't let you… destroy… Cybertron!

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:26.359
[Prime groaning]

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.778
And I won't let you enslave it!

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:32.741
-[groans]
-This will be extinction!

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:37.203
-[Prime grunting]
-[Megatron] Give me the Allspark!

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.205
-[Prime grunts]
-[Megatron groans]

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:42.417
-[Decepticons growls]
-[Prime grunts]

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:54.554
The circle closes, Prime.

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:58.850
You are defeated...

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.395
and the Allspark

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:08.777
will help me wipe out
what's left of the Autobots.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:10.737
Not today!

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.989
-[Megatron growls]
-[Prime grunts]

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:14.949
-[Prime grunts]
-[Megatron groans]

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.495
[both growling]

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:23.458
[Prime grunts]

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:30.757
[Megatron grunts]

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:32.884
No!

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.844
Decepticons,

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.596
kill them!

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.477
[Decepticons grunting]

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.696
-[loud blast]
-[Megatron grunts]

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:59.452
For Cybertron!

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:03.957
[roars]

